---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Recursos barefoot
description: Conceptos, transicion, salud del pie y criterios para elegir calzado con mas seguridad.
eyebrow: Resources
permalink: /recursos/
---
<div class="archive-grid">
  {% for post in collections.recursos %}
    <article class="post-card">
      <a href="{{ post.url }}">
        <img src="{{ post.data.image }}" alt="{{ post.data.imageAlt or post.data.title }}" loading="lazy">
        <div class="post-card-content">
          <div class="post-meta"><span>{{ post.data.category }}</span></div>
          <h3>{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
        </div>
      </a>
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
